"<ul><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>The Basics of Using Our Site:</strong> Hey there! Just a heads-up: when you use our website, it means you’re cool with all the rules we have. You’ve got to make sure you’re also following any laws that apply where you live. Not on board with our rules? Then, please don’t use the site. Remember, all the stuff on here, like texts and images, is owned by us or someone else and protected by copyright laws.\n<p><strong>P.S.: At SOS Admissions, we play by the book and stick to the rules of colleges and universities.</strong></p></div></li><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>How You Can Use Our Stuff:</strong> We’re okay with you downloading stuff from our site, but it’s just for you to use in a non-money-making way. Think of it like borrowing, not owning. So, no showing it off in public, selling it, or changing it. And please don’t try to figure out how our software works by taking it apart.\n<p>If you don’t play by these rules, we’ll have to say goodbye and take away your access. And you’ll need to delete anything you downloaded from us, whether it’s on paper or your computer.</p></div></li><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>Just So You Know (About Our Website Content):</strong> Everything on our site is just as it is, we’re not making any promises about how perfect or suitable it is. We’re also not responsible if there are mistakes or if we’re stepping on anyone’s toes regarding copyrights.</div></li><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>Not Our Fault:</strong> If something goes wrong while you’re using our site, like it messes up your computer or you lose data, we can’t be held responsible. This is just in case, but we hope everything works out fine for you.</div></li><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>Oops, We Might Make Mistakes:</strong> We try our best, but sometimes we might have a typo or a photo that’s not quite right. We’re not guaranteeing that everything is 100% accurate or up-to-date. We might change things around sometimes, and we’re not always going to give a heads-up when we do.</div></li><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>About Other Websites We Link To:</strong> If we’ve got links to other websites, it doesn’t mean we’re giving them our seal of approval. We’re not in charge of what they say or do. So, if you decide to check them out, it’s all on you.</div></li><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>We Can Change These Rules:</strong> Just a reminder:We reserve the right to modify or reverse any of the terms of use at any time without notice. By using this website, you agree to whatever changes might be made at any time.</div></li><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>The Legal Stuff:</strong> If any legal issues come up, we’ll handle them based on the laws in California, even if those laws conflict with others.</div></li><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>We Care About Your Privacy:</strong> Your privacy is super important to us. We want you to know how we collect and use your personal info. Here’s the deal:\n<ul>\n<li>We’ll tell you why we need your info at the time we ask for it.</li>\n<li>We’ll only use your info for what we said we would, and we’ll ask you first if we want to use it for anything else, unless the law tells us we have to.</li>\n<li>We won’t keep your info for longer than we need to.</li>\n<li>We promise to collect your info fairly and with your okay. And we’ll only collect what we need.</li>\n<li>We’ll do our best to keep your info safe from getting lost or ending up in the wrong hands.</li>\n<li>You can always ask us what we’re doing with your info.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></li><li><span><i></i></span><div><strong>Keeping It Honest:</strong> Being honest in academics is a big deal for us. Our team has worked with top colleges, so we know the drill. We provide admissions consulting and application essay writing and editing based on verified information supplied by our clients. Applicants must follow the requirements and academic integrity policies of their target institutions. We do not fabricate experiences or supporting information.</div></li></ul>"
